{
  "spec": "CONTROL.md §14.7, README: your server or none",
  "note": "A notice counts only from the rule's own receiver: the same notice from another receiver the machine is paired with is `no_match`, and so is one from a receiver that sent on a topic it was never given. A clock rule needs no receiver at all: it runs on a machine paired with none.",
